# SYSTEM 1: ATLAS AUTONOMOUS PROJECT SCOUTING, MEASUREMENT, SELECTION, AND QUALITY-CONTROL SYSTEM

## System Name

Atlas Autonomous Project Scouting, Measurement, Selection, and Quality-Control System

## Product Purpose

This is the system that allows Atlas to scale to 900–1000 premium projects without becoming a pile of shallow AI-generated lessons.

Its job is to continuously discover, score, rank, reject, refine, and recommend project ideas based on market demand, hiring relevance, portfolio strength, platform feasibility, validation strength, cloud relevance, and role-path coverage.

## Why This System Exists

Without this system, Atlas risks scaling in the wrong direction:

* too many generic projects
* duplicate projects
* trendy but low-value topics
* fake cloud projects
* projects that cannot be validated
* projects that do not impress hiring managers
* projects that do not produce portfolio artifacts
* projects with weak or misleading claims

This system prevents that by treating project creation as a curriculum intelligence pipeline.

